{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE5L0JsdWUlMjBTdG9yeSUyMCUyODIwMTklMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Blue Story","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/qI4Rw83LxKq07xIjM3RcbKcWpAM.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zbLbjvbDph2eTYhAWWH1rbM0cP5.jpg","description":"Blue Story is a tragic tale of a friendship between Timmy and Marco, two young boys from opposing postcodes. Timmy, a shy, smart, naive and timid young boy from Deptford, goes to school in Peckham where he strikes up a friendship with Marco, a charismatic, streetwise kid from the local area. Although from warring postcodes, the two quickly form a firm friendship until it is tested and they wind up on rival sides of a street war. Blue Story depicts elements of Rapman's own personal experiences and aspects of his childhood.","releaseInfo":"2019","genres":["Crime","Drama","Romance","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.3","runtime":"91 min","cast":["Stephen Odubola","Micheal Ward","Khali Best","Karla-Simone Spence","Eric Kofi Abrefa","Max Fincham","Kadeem Ramsay","Rohan Nedd"],"director":["Rapman"],"released":"2019-11-22T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Their bond made them brothers. The streets made them enemies.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Stephen Odubola","character":"Timmy","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lH8vGaiAE0cZZ0J1ANDyIgQfhA8.jpg"},{"name":"Micheal Ward","character":"Marco","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/fnVDz5q9Vtocm2VY5tU3voP6RxG.jpg"},{"name":"Khali Best","character":"Killy","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bcREQqV0EN4FoywV4NWfydesOdu.jpg"},{"name":"Karla-Simone Spence","character":"Leah","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/LI66wi3tsmO1LhsbogLP86Bh1l.jpg"},{"name":"Eric Kofi Abrefa","character":"Switcher","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/l804UyJ1wLVGS6lGH9UhgW1j6fq.jpg"},{"name":"Max Fincham","character":"Young Dwayne","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cR1voDGyAcGWrOHMZ4WJgX87Vqn.jpg"},{"name":"Kadee